{"id":"e91fa4dc23720da7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/556_量化模态逻辑_QML.md","title":"556 量化模态逻辑 QML","display":"556_量化模态逻辑_QML","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始签名\">1. 原始签名</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{556}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{556}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一阶签名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{556}=(\\mathcal F_{556},\\mathcal R_{556},\\operatorname{arF}_{556},\\operatorname{arR}_{556}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{556}=(\\mathcal F_{556},\\mathcal R_{556},\\operatorname{arF}_{556},\\operatorname{arR}_{556}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{556}\\cap\\mathcal R_{556}=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arF}_{556}:\\mathcal F_{556}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arR}_{556}:\\mathcal R_{556}\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_{556}\\cap\\mathcal R_{556}=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arF}_{556}:\\mathcal F_{556}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arR}_{556}:\\mathcal R_{556}\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span> 是变量项和函数项生成的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_{556}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_{556}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arF}_{556}(f)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arF}_{556}(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{556}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{556}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arR}_{556}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arR}_{556}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>等词的显示记号定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s=t:=\\operatorname{eq}(s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s=t:=\\operatorname{eq}(s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(s=t)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(s=t)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{556}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{556})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{556}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{556})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(s=t)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(s=t)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{556}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{556}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{556})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{556},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{556}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{556})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{556},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{556}(X)=v_m\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{556}(X)=v_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。项替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{556}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subt}_{556}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[x:=u]\">\\(r[x:=u]\\)</span>，由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=u]=\n\\begin{cases}\nu,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=u]=\n\\begin{cases}\nu,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)[x:=u]=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=u].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)[x:=u]=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=u].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{556}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{556}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=u]\">\\(A[x:=u]\\)</span>，由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s=t)[x:=u]=(s[x:=u]=t[x:=u]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s=t)[x:=u]=(s[x:=u]=t[x:=u]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=u]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=u].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=u]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=u].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=u]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[x:=u]=\\neg(A[x:=u]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=u]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[x:=u]=\\neg(A[x:=u]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=u]=A[x:=u]\\to B[x:=u],\n\\quad\n(\\Box A)[x:=u]=\\Box(A[x:=u]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=u]=A[x:=u]\\to B[x:=u],\n\\quad\n(\\Box A)[x:=u]=\\Box(A[x:=u]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\">\\(y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=u]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yB,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(B[x:=u]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(u),\\\\\n\\forall z((B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=u]),\n&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(u),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=u]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yB,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(B[x:=u]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(u),\\\\\n\\forall z((B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=u]),\n&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(u),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中第三行的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{556}(\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(u)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{556}(\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{556}(u)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\\)</span>，定义外层绑定变量改名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{556}(\\forall yB,y,z)=\\forall z(B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{556}(\\forall yB,y,z)=\\forall z(B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{556}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{556}\\)</span> 为所有二元关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的集合，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal E_{556}\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal E_{556}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,s&#39;,t&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(s,t,s&#39;,t&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=s&#39;\">\\(s=s&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=t&#39;\">\\(t=t&#39;\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((s=t),(s&#39;=t&#39;)\\bigr)\\in E\">\\(\\bigl((s=t),(s&#39;=t&#39;)\\bigr)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{556}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{556}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arR}_{556}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arR}_{556}(R)=n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\rho:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\">\\(\\tau,\\rho:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\rho\">\\(\\tau=\\rho\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\rho))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\rho))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\">\\((\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Box A,\\Box B)\\in E\">\\((\\Box A,\\Box B)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\">\\(y,z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall yB,\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{556}(\\forall yB,y,z)\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall yB,\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{556}(\\forall yB,y,z)\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,556}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{556}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,556}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{556}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{556}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{556}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{556}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{556}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{556}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{556}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{556}=\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{556}=\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{556}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{556}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}^{556}=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}^{556}=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}^{556}=\\{s=t\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}^{556}=\\{s=t\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{556},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{556}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{556}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{556}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{556}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{556}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{556}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{556}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{556}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{556}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}^{556}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{556}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{556}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{556}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{556}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{556}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{556}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{556}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列六种条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{556}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{556}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{556}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall xA_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{556}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{556}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{556}(G)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{556}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{556}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,556}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,556}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\)</span>，定义末行函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma}:\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma}:\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记上述末行函数族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{556}\n=\n(\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma})_{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{556}\n=\n(\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma})_{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{556}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{556}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{556}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{556,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-有限检查对象的边界\">8. 有限检查对象的边界</h1>\n<p>本条目不另设缺少前提数据的局部“基础 QML 证书”。有限检查对象恰为第 6 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{556}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>：每个公理行直接校验其属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{556}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{556}\\)</span>，每个规则行连同全部较早前提、量词变量与依赖侧条件由第 6 节对应子句校验。可证性只由该证明对象的末行存在性定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目在一阶模态语言中加入等词公理族；不加入 Barcan、Converse Barcan 或存在谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{QML}_{556}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma_{556},\\mathsf{Var}_{556},\\mathsf{Tm}_{556},\\mathsf{Frm}_{556},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{556},\\operatorname{FV}_{556},\\operatorname{BV}_{556},\\operatorname{fresh}_{556},\n\\operatorname{Subt}_{556},\\operatorname{Sub}_{556},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{556},\\equiv_{\\alpha,556},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{556},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{556},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{556},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{556},\\mathsf{Proof}_{556},\\operatorname{last}_{556},\\vdash_{556}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{QML}_{556}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma_{556},\\mathsf{Var}_{556},\\mathsf{Tm}_{556},\\mathsf{Frm}_{556},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{556},\\operatorname{FV}_{556},\\operatorname{BV}_{556},\\operatorname{fresh}_{556},\n\\operatorname{Subt}_{556},\\operatorname{Sub}_{556},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{556},\\equiv_{\\alpha,556},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{556},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{556},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{556},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{556},\\mathsf{Proof}_{556},\\operatorname{last}_{556},\\vdash_{556}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含带等词量化模态句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含域、世界、可达关系、解释、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始签名","text":"1. 原始签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-有限检查对象的边界","text":"8. 有限检查对象的边界","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math"